      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'End Credits


    Congratulations on reaching the end!


    Deck of Runes
    is a dark fantasy deck-building card battler heavily inspired by "Slay the Spire".
    The game was designed and developed by me using Unity 6.4, with assistance from
    Claude AI as my development assistant and Leonardo AI as my creative assistant.


    Special
    thanks to GameDev.tv for their course Unity Card Battler: Code a Deck-Building
    Card Game in C#, which provided an excellent learning foundation.


    Many
    thanks as well to the incredible creators on itch.io and the open-source community
    whose work helped bring this prototype to life, including:


    * Frostwind
    for the spell visual effects.

    * LuizMelo for the Player character and Vanrotten
    the Warlock artwork.

    * All the talented artists, musicians, and developers
    whose free visual and audio assets made this project possible.


    And finally...


    Thank
    you for playing Deck of Runes. I hope you enjoyed this prototype as much as I
    enjoyed creating it.

'
